'''''Passages, Knocking Echoes in Dreams''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Light Slips the Gate, Shadow Greets the Throne]].

==Steps==
# Fall asleep and enter Tribbie's dream
# Fall asleep and continue Tribbie's dream
# Speak with Aglaea
# Observe Phainon conversing with Anaxa
# Have an audience with Oronyx and regain memories
# Find "saffron" and have an audience with Oronyx
# Follow Trianne and look for "saffron"
# Read the letter Trianne found
# Continue following Trianne and look for "saffron"
# Investigate the dolium Trianne found
# Have an audience with Oronyx and try to convince them
# Keep observing Phainon conversing with Anaxa
# Look for Oronyx
# Follow Trianne and look for "saffron"
# Continue following Trianne and look for "saffron"

