:'''Tribbie:''' Wait... where's Trianne? Is she back?
:'''Phainon:''' We only saw the two of you collapsed on the side of the road when we arrived...
:'''Hyacine:''' Dannie and I looked around, but we couldn't find any traces of Lady Trianne...
:'''Trinnon:''' What about the black-robed swordmaster?
:'''Phainon:''' ...Blast it! Of course it's them!
:'''Phainon:''' We were still too late. I fear something bad has happened to {{Rubi|Oronyx's|Time Titan}} Coreflame.
:'''Hyacine:''' Then, Lady Trianne...
:'''Tribbie:''' She doesn't have much divine power left. We can barely sense anything...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We need to go after that black-robed swordmaster.
