:'''Trianne:''' Tribbie! Trinnon! Look what I found! Is this the "safari"?
:'''Tribbie:''' Coming! '''We&ast;'''ll take a look...
:'''Tribbie:''' ...But Trianne, there's nothing in here.
:'''Trianne:''' What? It was right in this dolium...
:'''Trianne:''' Huh? There's really nothing here? That can't be! I swear I saw it...
:'''Tribbie:''' ...
:'''Trianne:''' I swear! Trianne is telling the truth! It was right there &mdash; where did it go?
:'''Trianne:''' Trinnon, Tribbie, why aren't you saying anything? Trianne can't seem to hear '''you''' at all...
:'''Trinnon:''' ...'''We''' were just lost in '''our''' thoughts. Don't worry, Trianne.
:'''Trinnon:''' What you saw was likely a Janus hare. '''We''' must have startled it away.
:'''Trianne:''' ...Okay.
:'''Tribbie:''' Could {{Rubi|Oronyx|Time Titan}} be trying to make '''us''' falter? But why would they do that?
:'''Trinnon:''' Something feels off... Tribbie, don't you think the temple is a little too quiet?
:'''Tribbie:''' What do you mean?
